{
  "work_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia",
  "source_path": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia.json",
  "source_language": "chu",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "143122363a0875b0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "A homily by John Chrysostom, Archbishop, for Great Wednesday. On envy, concerning what is said in the Gospel."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "f8671bef65afeb46",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The Pharisees went out and plotted against Jesus, to destroy him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "85f43825eb1910e6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "All of you who are disciples of Elijah, who did not scorn the widow’s poor table, stay with us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "5e5bf2ef4a9d8d2f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For we too have prepared such a table, poor in words, with a single loaf [?] upon it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "5b15c06e73801e04",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Not one that millstones ground, hands kneaded, and fire finished,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "739fbb30f75fae30",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but one that the Virgin brought forth without plowing and without seed, that the cross ripened, that the Father perfected, and that the twelve baskets of the apostles held."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "b4665c7c78f24260",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Mary gave birth to this bread, and the Church received it, and every day we eat it,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "3b4972d9647ace78",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and it never runs out. Having placed this bread before you on my humble table,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "6c827a45d5b8d51c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I wanted to keep the vessel of my tongue closed in silence. For the quarrelsome Jews’"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "9ef9239896c300d4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "evil outpouring, kindled against the Savior, compels even stones to speak. For what have we just heard?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "b054165219809879",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The Pharisees went out and plotted against Jesus, to destroy him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "262687bfcd4a9183",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But what is the charge for which they want to destroy him? That he healed a man on the Sabbath"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "c40e4967b35fe8ce",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and stretched out an idle, withered hand for work on a day of rest."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "5b4bf87f53e0f275",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Oh, the insensibility of the Jews, who do not understand that it is fitting for what was at creation [?]—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "bc2fbf0d4053e76c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Adam’s right hand, the hand that touched the tree and withered through transgression—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "dcf9b5ad488e1c74",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to be fashioned anew by the potter out of earthen clay."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "423a0e7529d700d0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or that it is fitting for what has been [?] by demons and godless temples"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "c0b41a7193481a03",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and defiled by bloodshed to be stretched out pure toward heaven. But they are grieved"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198v.s14",
      "source_sha256": "4c0d6d290539f296",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "because he came to do good to people and to save souls."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198v.s15",
      "source_sha256": "dbe4e8b0e276b327",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And they avenge the Sabbath observance, but do not understand the Savior’s miracle."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.198v.s16",
      "source_sha256": "1790af092a2e3abd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Why, then, Pharisees, did you not instead worry about yourselves? Or why did you not conspire against Manasseh"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "5b90775388df3f96",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "when he was sawing Isaiah apart with a saw? When [?] did you not plot against Herod?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "234c4e517ea2d1c0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He deprived the infants of their senses and mothers of their children. Then one could see the infants like ripe ears of grain,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "43254cc527448d17",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "lying cut down by a single blade, not yet having a firm kernel within [?],"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "60fdca6360014430",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "nor having changed the bloom of the ear of grain, but still alike living on infant food and milk."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "f61ed7e893a4458f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Struck by Herod in fierce anger, [?] of the city, when there were cries and anguish among men and women"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "2a8c566e62fa472c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "in the city streets and lanes, and fathers and mothers stood with their hair loose,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "fefe99d29d2cfdd1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "grieving deeply over the slaughter of their young children;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "e103800080401e5c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "when Bethlehem was dyed crimson with the blood of infants, and the fresh must of young grape clusters"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "8ea739d3e2a68311",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "was mixed with the parents’ warm tears; when the fathers’ faces had been changed by weeping,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "57a27ceb522c8a99",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and the mothers’ hearts were writhing with pain; when, within the mothers’ breasts,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "64dbb58e71c3e3a1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the spirit groaned, pinned down by pain, and their breath came unnaturally through their nostrils;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "1513c0939ed08ff9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "when the fathers’ and mothers’ eyes were likened to springs of water,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "a5a6be592a0d63f2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and tears, boiling like silver, dripped down their cheeks onto the ground;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199r.s14",
      "source_sha256": "e018e974ec4c1a93",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "when the women’s hair was [?] by their fingernails, they made a mockery of sorrow. But you think perversely and act perversely."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199r.s15",
      "source_sha256": "d2db5456c96fc2b2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And those whom it was fitting to cover with swaddling clothes, [?] to kill the murderers; and those deserving"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "96b402271656c227",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "death you do not kill, but you torment the innocent and the righteous."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "9876fce07168eb13",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For it is said, “Do not kill the innocent and the righteous.” O disorderly order!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "665ca3fae72534eb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O lawless law, prompted by the devil, written by demons,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "bc890adfdd14dcec",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and observed by the Jews to this very day! What sort of law is this: to release a murderer"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "9756ca247bf939dd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and destroy the one who gives life to those who have been killed? For they held Barabbas, whom they had arrested for robbery,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "302345c0fcb18fe6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and begged Pilate to release him. But Jesus, who brought back to life those struck down by the devil,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "359c0bc84563f295",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "they handed over to be crucified. “And the Pharisees went out,” it says, “and took counsel against Jesus, to destroy him.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "6819449c55a12871",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O great mind of madness! And counsel that is no counsel, full of senselessness!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "88b3c41b9db738f6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The source of good things gives them rivers of kindness. Yet even as they drew grace,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "bc974ccb7861fbfd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "they gathered murder in their hearts. When those who had sores on their bodies were being freed from them,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "a780c41e3fb0177c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "then these men, though they had no sores on their bodies, were stricken with envy and sick at heart."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "dfe6db19b658b352",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The hungry in the wilderness were fed until they were satisfied, but these men, amid an abundance of faith,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "dc153de253996bd4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "were dying of the hunger of unbelief. Water was being changed into wine, but they, without tasting wine,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199v.s14",
      "source_sha256": "6e87681353ffdd81",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "staggered, drunk with envy. They saw the flowing rivers of blood brought to a halt."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.199v.s15",
      "source_sha256": "cdb7524efc63670e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They wanted to choke with jealousy. Those who had demons within them, being freed from the demons,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "b6eb681dc82b2391",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "were coming to their senses. But those overcome by envy were behaving worse than the demon-possessed."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "ce4c6daaf11d3895",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The blind, who had no sight, were receiving light, while those who had sight were becoming blind. The ears of the deaf were being opened,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "c6a93a88b2495ac5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but their hearts were hardened, and they were plotting murder."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "4eee68d29e10f67c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The sea, gathering up its waves, was preparing itself for the Master's passage, but their hearts foamed with waves from murderous mouths [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "11c8cbe602dab644",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The violent winds were calming the mighty force of their breath into gentleness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "54f11f631792e1b4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But they, tossed about by jealous envy, were plotting the storm of the crucifixion. O envy, so fruitful in producing death!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "6e219e1b6c471931",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For what nail is as sharp as envy, which pierces the heart of the one who harbors it?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "af6488492090b48c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "What disease drives beauty from the face as envy causes the beautifully blooming flower"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "0d5bc109a626796c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of love to wither? Water extinguishes fire, but the countless springs of teachers cannot stop envy."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "3b4ec8cfca7f81ac",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "A single whetstone cleans rust from iron, but David's five stones [?] the envy that rose up all the more in Saul [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "7f721ebf19caf345",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They say that there are [?], but there is no [?] for envy."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "79a5f654f1c8fe29",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For just as a worm eats the heart of an oak and makes it wither,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "cd87bb66fd3e69f9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so envy eats away at the heart of the one who harbors it and makes it wither."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200r.s14",
      "source_sha256": "dd1f43a265484c8a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "However much we tell you about envy, beloved, we have not yet begun to speak about envy."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "4e9c67257d30ddbd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The tongues of orators, the words of skilled speakers, and the discourses of teachers cannot describe its wickedness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "56f53bab9dcab9a1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Love of the Word is the fulfillment of the law, while the deceit of envy is the fulfillment of murder."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "75d2df115ae82484",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O envy, a ship full of [?] pus! The one who equips you, your ruler, is the devil."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "6dcccceaed7aaa9e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The serpent is your helmsman, and Cain your forerunner. For the devil gives you evil riches."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "b46e33d84ec69baa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The serpent, steering the ship, brought Adam down into the flood of death. And Cain is your forerunner,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "11859dd17bc48071",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "because it was through you, envy, that he committed the first murder."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "829461dba00ce4d2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Your sail has been there from the beginning, in Paradise, at the tree of disobedience."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "48b9703f65d42b46",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Your ropes are the bonds of sin; your cables are envies, and your sailors are demons."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "25037665131e68f5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Your oars are deceit, strife, and hypocrisy; your crossbeams are the envious. O ship full of countless evils!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "8fa9d26e6db06c33",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If anyone seeks hypocrisy, he will find it there. If he seeks deceit, it is born there. For where there is envy—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "0fe7a1ab99cea2d2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "There dwell enmities and quarrels and deceptions and disputes and slanderous words,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "5ac16714ea89d342",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and blasphemies and insults, and whatever else we may name, or whatever we may leave unmentioned."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "a9a0841554800efe",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The unbaptized ship, envy, carries all this. The flood cannot sink this [?] of envy."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200v.s14",
      "source_sha256": "dc51c727ba803181",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But Jesus, by the power of the Spirit, sank it in the springs of baptism."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200v.s15",
      "source_sha256": "1d1cec798cf2b968",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This ship had iron anchors, but they were burned up by the nails of Jesus."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.200v.s16",
      "source_sha256": "a09fe5840e773544",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This ship had a sail, but the devil took it and devised a temptation for Christ [?]. This ship had"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "633bc609eb71f0e6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "a rope, but Judas took it and hanged himself. The Jews boarded it, struck against the rock, and were shipwrecked in their faith."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "8bc5d58b2b9088d3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For this reason, even now [?], they were swimming in the depths of ignorance."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "582bf3e84dc6af5c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Only those of them who can cling to the ship that carries Christ escape."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "e4f3af26df91a2fb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But the wicked will perish in unbelief, dying at sea."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "ac6ca27932f7638e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If only those who are still in the depths had fled to Jonah inside the whale,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "477d1aa1dd6fe20d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "perhaps they would have learned from him about devotion to Christ,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "635144c803241fa8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and would have been cast out alive with him in Nineveh. But now, having closed the eyes of their hearts,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "e718f1a17067a62e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "they do not run to him even when they see the radiant one of godliness sending forth rays of faith from the cross in the midst of the earth,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "53e775b649b3bcc3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "nor do they come to life by fleeing to John, the preacher of repentance."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "4fe02f915e6f9f13",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“The Pharisees went out,” it says, “and took counsel to destroy him.” Where did they go out from?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "5afdb37c2a0662da",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Not from envy, but from the Law. For if they had not departed from the Law, they would not have blasphemed the one who established the Law."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "dc92afbd74e0103f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“And the Pharisees went out,” it says. From where? From the commandment of God,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "9a0da3e3fe2f9860",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "which enlightens the eyes of the heart. For the Lord’s commandments enlighten the eyes from afar."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201r.s14",
      "source_sha256": "95b28b0a9ffb98a5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The Pharisees went out—from where? From the commandment, from the Law, from life."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201r.s15",
      "source_sha256": "389da54eebc95e38",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For those who plot death for others are themselves the first to fall away from the light of life."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201r.s16",
      "source_sha256": "cdf65cea3046606d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“And the Pharisees went out and took counsel.” Scripture did not say from whom they took it, stirring our minds"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "33ec58b660ff5347",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to inquire. “And they went out and took counsel.” From whom? Clearly, from the original"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "526fe3eb251b011a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "murderer, the devil, “to destroy him.” By what means? Will you do it with stones or swords,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "366e2b109ef9eed1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "or fire or water? Their counselor was the devil, who had first destroyed the tree."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "65ddf6a8094109fd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He again resorts to that with which he killed Adam, and he conferred with them about crucifying Jesus on a tree."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "bd75bd2fe3e55161",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He did not know that this tree also undoes the first transgression involving a tree"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "c1666898792f4d27",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and gives life to humanity. And the Pharisees went out and took counsel to destroy him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "88acc3ae4274b91e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O evil counsel, sown by envy and exposed by envy! O empty reasoning!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "5831e432e4444894",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For they do not know that God cannot perish. They may readily destroy the perishable lamp of his body,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "41a2a6741fba64fe",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but they cannot extinguish the flame of his divinity. O wondrous and marvelous deed!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "9d128d9113db2b66",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Jesus came to seek and restore what was lost, but these men seek to destroy the benefactor of the lost."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "cad8699ab21793fb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Tell me, O Jews, for what reason did you take counsel against him? But they are ashamed to speak."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "d4afc3e974fe7be3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But through their shame we shall expose their own defeat. “Why,” they said, “does he raise the dead"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "775766d54a3e4fc8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and heal the sick? Why does he speak and perform miracles? And why does he teach?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.201v.s14",
      "source_sha256": "b58a19f47ef34eab",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For all these reasons we want to destroy him.” When young children took up branches"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "ccb158824cc37811",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and with branches proclaimed his victory, crying, “Hosanna in the highest! Blessed is he who comes in the name of the Lord,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "e2571166cac04d19",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the King of Israel!” then they gnashed their teeth as though pierced by goads. For praises, to those who harbor envy,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "a5dcf6c6bf09a352",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "are weapons against the envious. And they came to Jesus and said to him, “Do you not hear what these children are saying?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "d776ad85d620605f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Do you not know that the prophetic scripture was being fulfilled: “From the mouths of infants and nursing babies you have perfected praise”?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "5101ec8d3b463626",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When Jezebel wanted to seize Naboth’s vineyard,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "67f91fdb13e556c5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "she wrote many letters, and you listened gladly. But when Pilate displayed the truth on a board,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "515a595da2285891",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "you became angry and forbade him to write. What did they say? “Do not write, ‘The King of the Jews.’”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "bf1e2c8d572e10c4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is, “Do not reveal the truth, and may God not expose our insolence [?].” It would be better to be angry like this with those"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "7ac53f78e961fadd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "who write compositions for dancers. For you will not make them innocent by listening to their songs."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "88614cb28424addb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Now you are angry about divine teachings because they are written down for the thanksgiving of believers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "06352b1d1e0c58c2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You do not forbid the writing of Philistion’s foolish dialogues, but you forbid the writing of praises of God,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "756712216ff23e37",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "by which we are guided to heaven. For even if someone now [?] teaches in simple words,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "eb656fbf8d083d12",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "nevertheless, speaking about God, he imparts great wisdom. For it is better, especially for the young, to have a teacher of divinely inspired words [?],"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202r.s14",
      "source_sha256": "3844aa0f98b908a9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to sing continually and keep the mind pure, rather than have demonic teachings."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "dbcd41522e0327f0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "Praising [?], to rage in delusion: “Do not write, ‘King of the Jews.’” Why should he not write it? What harm do the letters do you?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "1f659b643f941535",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "What property or possessions does the truthful inscription deprive you of?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "98bb050c9fd405f2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "But even the Pharisees, by saying this to Pilate, prompted him to write the words of truth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "68dab2417e48cb42",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "He said to them, “What I have written.” It is fitting for us also to speak to those who blaspheme the faith,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "a57db526a116d3e2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "when they wish to dispute with the God-bearing men, and especially to say to them, “What I have written, I have written.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "6d03dec651ee6a2a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "The Pharisees went out and took counsel against him, to destroy him. But Jesus, knowing this, withdrew from there."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "21333906e2dc1cdd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "He had not learned it from anyone, but knew it himself, for, knowing hearts, he knows what is in a person."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "93b33ae35b784dac",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "As John the Evangelist says, “He had no need for anyone to testify about a person.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "a36ae5dbfb2d1eed",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "And Jesus, knowing this, withdrew from there—not because he feared death, but because he was waiting for the time of his crucifixion."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "012738d9feffad59",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "It was fitting for him first to raise the dead and heal the sick,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "3811a87c4d7ae246",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "to satisfy those who hunger for righteousness, to strengthen them in faith, and only then to come to his glorious death—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "9f604c8d71df01d5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "or rather, into the bridal chamber. It was fitting for him first to set up the mystical wood of the cross,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "ebc80068c1a7cdf9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "and only then, with fervent spirit, to hasten to those who lie in Hades."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202v.s14",
      "source_sha256": "fb460c690330bd6e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "But Jesus, knowing this, withdrew from there. He withdrew to where he cannot be seen."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.202v.s15",
      "source_sha256": "01460d63b7d5ef1d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "He fled to where envy does not arise. He withdrew to where love dwells, and the Son and the Father and the Holy Spirit. To him be glory"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-de-invidia#Supr.203r",
      "source_sha256": "774950919764f1ed",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "forever and ever. Amen."
    }
  ]
}
